          "title": "Hydrate the oats",
          "description": "Boil the water and pour it over the rolled oats. Let them sit for 15–20 minutes until they absorb the water."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "mix-wet-ingredients-vegan-oatmeal-pie",
        "en": {
          "title": "Add wet ingredients",
          "description": "Once the oats have absorbed the water, add both sugars, vegetable oil, apple puree, and orange zest. Mix thoroughly."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "combine-dry-mixture-vegan-oatmeal-pie",
        "en": {
          "title": "Combine dry ingredients",
          "description": "In a separate bowl, combine the flour, salt, and baking soda. Gradually add the dry mixture to the oat mixture, stirring after each addition."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "assemble-pie-vegan-oatmeal-pie",
        "en": {
          "title": "Assemble the pie",
          "description": "Grease a baking pan with a little vegetable oil. Preheat the oven to 180°C (350°F). Transfer the batter to the pan and spread it evenly. Arrange the berries on top in a single layer."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "bake-pie-vegan-oatmeal-pie",
        "en": {
          "title": "Bake the pie",
          "description": "Place the pan in the preheated oven and bake for 60–65 minutes. Check doneness by inserting a wooden skewer into the center; it should come out clean."
        }
      }
